    "a": "No technical experience is needed, but the trek is rated Moderate. The longest walking day (Day 3) takes around 7 hours, and the summit morning on Day 4 starts before dawn at over 4,000 m. If you can walk comfortably for 5 to 7 hours on consecutive days, you will manage this trek well."
